text It's past noon...
text I yawn as I walk down the empty path to school.
text *Puff*
text @[Tomoya]
text ...?
text It feels like I kicked something soft...
text It continues to roll across the ground, and finally stops when it hits a street light.
text Short legs suddenly sprout from what I thought was a round clump.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I walk closer toward it.
text Then, fearfully, I look at the clump.
