text @[Botan]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text What should I do...?
text Should I just pretend nothing happened and take off...?
text If there are no witnesses, then no one would know I was the one who knocked him out.
choice Just walk away|Bring him along to school|Act like it's a tragedy
